Total Fantasy Knockout
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.020
Mister, did you beat that thing?

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:33.530
Yes. And with only one punch.

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:34.660
Huntsman LV 1 Acquired
Yes. And with only one punch.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:36.490
Whoa. That's insane.
Huntsman LV 1 Acquired

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:39.770
You did really well for your first time!

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:41.470
It's because you taught me so well.

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:44.500
If I go to a big town, will
I be able to sell this pelt?

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:49.230
I think so, but I've never seen a
creature like this before, so...

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:51.010
That's...

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.500
Chief, do you know it?

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.200
It's the guardian deity
of this forest, I believe.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:56.390
Guardian deity?

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.010
Then, is it bad that I killed it?

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:02.650
Not at all. It's no deity of ours, you see.

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:04.560
Please, don't let it bother you.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.150
He seems to be implying something.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.840
Mister, where's the goddess?

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:10.520
Oh, still asleep.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:13.490
I think it's about time I should go wake her.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:15.990
Hey, Tachibana—

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:21.490
Oh, hey. Morning.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:25.770
My hair's so long, it just won't dry.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.250
