Episode 3 .

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:36.760
Sorry.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.320
I'll be more careful next time.

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.690
Please do.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:44.470
The first naked female body I've seen
is yours. Just think how I feel.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.510
My mood is rock bottom.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:48.800
It's not the first.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.700
Wait, is it seriously your first?

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:55.480
Well, since we're living together,
it was bound to happen. So just accept it.

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.240
You could be just a little
contrite, couldn't you?

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:02.340
But you know, I was excited at first!

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:05.330
Like, "I'll be in the
bath with a female body!"

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.200
But...

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:10.250
The look of this body is so far
removed from my real age.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.500
It reminds me of my little sister.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.210
It just...

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:15.460
Nothing happened.

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:17.460
I'm happy for you.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:20.720
What is it?

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:24.620
Jinguuji, are you really into
childlike blondes' faces?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.600
I will slug you.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.920
The most terrifying thing about
your appearance is the fact that

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:32.600
it warps the preferences
of anyone who sees you.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.610
It warps... preferences?

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:38.110
Your physical appearance...

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:41.630
There's something we might call "magic"
embedded in it which supersedes your looks.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:46.010
The fact that it can change my thinking
against my will is terrifying.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:47.620
Hurry up and return to being a man.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:51.130
Well, I'm starting to have
a little fun with this.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:55.280
Normally, I'd never be able to
make you this flustered.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:58.640
And the villagers really fawn all over me!

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:01.480
It gives me a feeling of superiority, and—

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.280
You want to go back to being a man
as quickly as possible, right?

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.390
Yes, yes! Yes, I do!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.420
You do, don't you?

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:10.540
Leave it to me!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.930
I'll find a way.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.400
You're really scary sometimes, you know that?

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:16.650
So, what are we going to do next?

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:18.920
I asked around a little
in the village,

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.650
But it didn't seem like anyone had
ever heard of a "demon lord."

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:24.670
I heard that there's a big town ahead,

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:27.910
so we should probably go
there and gather information.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:29.760
Now that we've acquired travel funds,

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.600
let's find a good time to go
and leave the village.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.910
Gotcha.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.460
flowing

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:39.210
Doesn't it seem fluffier
and shinier than yesterday?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.680
Why are you good at everything
down to drying hair?

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:43.960
I've seen it done at salons.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.300
Is it really something that you
can do after just watching?

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.810
Oh, yeah. What happened to the
forest that was on fire yesterday?

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:53.530
It rained, and I heard
that it put out the fire.

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:54.640
That's great.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.690
Please, let's handle this peacefully...

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.060
You expect me not to be enraged by this?!

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:02.460
I wanted to settle this peacefully, too.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.070
But I simply cannot!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.080
You weren't satisfied with just the forest,

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:09.580
so you reduced our guardian deity
to this unthinkable state as well?!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.980
Make your choice, humans!

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:15.460
Shall I destroy this village, or will you
point out the criminals who did this?!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.080
You know...

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:23.210
Seeing people get angry at each other
makes me uncomfortable.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:27.570
When I saw newbies at
work getting yelled at,

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.720
it made me feel like I was
getting yelled at, too.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:33.240
I understand what you mean,

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:36.990
but just now, it was definitely
us that she was angry with.

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:38.600
You think so, too?

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:40.320
Which means that...

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.830
We did not burn down the forest.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:45.470
Killing the guardian
deity was self-defense,

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.140
and there's nothing wrong with that!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:50.490
We should be apologizing!
Why are you speaking so arrogantly?

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.740
As soon as you show yourselves,
you begin giving excuses.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.520
Does that mean that you're
the ones who did this?

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:59.710
Yes. But we wish to negotiate.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:03.120
The guardian deity protected
our sacred forest.

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:06.550
If it attacked you, then you must
have trespassed on our sacred land.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.010
There is no room for negotiation here.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:11.080
And you have no right
to speak to us that way!

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:13.510
Like I said! Why are you being so arrogant?!

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:18.390
I'm so sorry. He's always been rude, you see.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.960
Enough. Just apologize!

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:20.520
I refuse.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.590
Oh, why is this guy so...

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:27.030
But I never imagined
I'd get to meet a real elf...

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.310
She's scary, but she's super beautiful!

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:31.160
I got to see something nice!

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:35.660
Hmph. Well, I suppose, for
a human, she's all right.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:39.160
That translucent skin. Those blue eyes.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:42.170
Golden hair and a well-proportioned face...

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.630
I will grant that she puts
effort into her appearance.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:46.670
But, well...

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:52.680
I am far more beautiful than she!

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.680
Why'd she take her clothes off?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.720
She's starting again.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.690
If she didn't do this,
she'd be fairly normal.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:04.640
Is my beauty so overwhelming
that you can't even speak?

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:09.700
That's right. We elves are followers
of the goddess of love and beauty!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:14.400
She is abundant, lovely, and splendid!
And we are her people!

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:17.640
These long ears are the proof of it!

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:21.330
If you're her people, then you
can't possibly be respectable.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.880
And the type of long ears
is different, isn't it?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.130
You two!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.710
Admit your crimes and beg for forgiveness.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:31.380
Press your heads to the ground
and sing praises of my beauty.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:34.250
You mean if we just kneel
on the ground, you'll forgive us?

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:35.920
Yes, my lady! With pleasure!

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:36.660
Tachibana.
Yes, my lady! With pleasure!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.140
Huh?

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.890
There is no need to do something like
that for an exhibitionist like her.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.400
Exhibitionist?!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.770
Th-Th-These garments were
bestowed upon us by the goddess!
I mean, she does have that look to her,
but there's a better way to say it.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:50.010
I simply spoke the truth. And anyway...
Passed down through my family for
generations, they are noble and...

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:52.910
I'm amazed that you can walk around
as nearly naked as you are.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.910
Listen to me when I'm talking to you!

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.770
Praise your beauty, you say?

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.910
I have no interest in
women in the first place.

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.370
And now that I've even grown
used to Tachibana's appearance,

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.170
you will not capture my attention.

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:06.670
Try it on some other sap.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.830
Hey, are you sure you're
okay with admitting to that?

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.930
Hm? I simply spoke the truth.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.720
This little...

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:20.760
Men are creatures who, once they've seen my
beautiful body, bring gifts and do as I say!

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:25.580
The men of this village bring me tribute
to try to please me, and yet...

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.450
Isn't that because you're
scary when you're displeased?

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:29.190
Shh!

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:32.600
That's right. Beauty is about popularity.

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:35.070
We'll decide this with a vote.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.800
Villagers!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:40.980
This girl or myself! Assemble before
the one you think is most beautiful!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.580
Crowded

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.830
I can't help feeling sorry for her.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:49.090
I-I-I think you're prettier than me, though!

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:52.230
I can't compare to you at all! Seriously!

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:53.220
Really, I mean it!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:56.090
Tachibana, sometimes, consolation
can hurt as much as a blade.

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:00.960
Take this opportunity to
reexamine yourself, woman.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:03.600
Perhaps you should first change
which deity you believe in.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:08.000
If you do, that good-for-nothing
nature of yours might improve.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:11.110
Don't just casually suggest
a religious conversion!

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:16.110
I see. Is that what this is?

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:19.870
You're adherents of some
heretical religion, aren't you?

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.050
Huh?

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.880
You brainwashed the villagers, didn't you?

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:24.940
Otherwise, this outcome would be unthinkable!

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:30.840
By causing my fall, you lessen the majesty
of our goddess! That is your plot!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:34.630
Defiling our sacred lands and killing our
guardian deity is all consistent with that goal!

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:37.630
I know that you don't want to
admit that you've been beaten,

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.430
but this is childish!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.890
I won't listen to words spoken
by those who follow heresy!

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:48.520
O Goddess, in your exalted seat,
master of the long ears,

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:51.900
here and now, I, your humble servant,
offer my beauty in your honor.

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:56.250
I beseech thee, cleanse away the
misfortune which would do me harm!

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.210
Is... Is that magic?!

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.280
Stay back, Tachibana.

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:07.160
If you die, I will be the most
beautiful being in this place.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.920
Die for my sake!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.290
It ended up being a really selfish reason!

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.970
She's just shooting those
off in a place like this?

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:18.800
Let's escape into the forest!

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:22.410
What was that?

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:24.990
Please refrain from touching
me so thoughtlessly.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.960
And holding hands is out of the question.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.020
You really are a pain, you know that, right?!

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:31.020
Fools.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:34.680
Entering into our home field
of your own volition...

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:37.530
Insulting our goddess is a grave crime!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:39.530
Atone for it with your deaths!

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:52.080
Drat. I've overdone it
and lost sight of them.

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.220
Sateyna! Ultina!

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:55.280
Yes, my lady.

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:56.710
We will begin searching for the enemy.

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.380
There's no need to grab me by the
scruff of the neck, is there?!

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:03.720
If I hadn't, you probably would have died.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:05.220
Died?

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:09.230
It's all right. Even if I die,
I'll make sure that you don't.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.480
You...

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.860
Don't you dare say you'll die,
even as a joke!

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:17.110
If you die, there's absolutely
no doubt I'll die, too!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.580
Understand?!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.360
I understand.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:25.630
Don't worry. Naturally,
I have no intention of dying.

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:27.370
And I'm not one to stay beaten.

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:30.680
Still, how are we gonna get close enough—

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:32.420
A rock?

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:42.670
Huh?

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.840
Premier!

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.100
Are you all right?

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.280
Your hair...

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:55.110
The symbol of your elvenhood...

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.750
Wha— Huh? What's this?

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.740
Pull yourself together!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:11.160
You're fighting a girl, you know?
Wasn't there a better way?

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:14.250
I have no intention of showing mercy
to those who would do you harm.

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:15.600
However...

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:18.900
I had no idea a simple stone
would be this powerful.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.510
One step wrong, and this could've
been a really grotesque sight.

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:23.510
At any rate...

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:27.370
It doesn't seem like it's a good time
to have a word with them.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.710
Let's get out of here quickly.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:30.640
Before things get any more volatile...

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.100
Those cretins.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:38.770
To think they'd even take our
guardian deity's pelt with them.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:43.630
Having been so mercilessly defeated,
I cannot return to our settlement.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.030
I will go after those two.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.030
Premier...

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:52.250
I shall deal a crushing blow to
those who so harmed our goddess.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.790
And I will retrieve our guardian deity.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:59.900
Then I will make them regret
having done this to me!

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:03.180
When she flies into a rage,
her true feelings come out in the end.

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:05.930
And she was only just crying her heart out.

