00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:40.840
We ended up in exactly the
opposite roles as back then.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.160
I'm tired!

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:45.060
Having to get around by walking
is too harsh for modern people!

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.470
Stupid! Seriously, so stupid!

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:50.350
We have to walk another three days
if we want to reach the town.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.970
Nope. Not possible.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:54.820
I suppose it can't be helped.

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.330
We'll rest here for today.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.800
Baths really do make me feel rejuvenated.

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:06.710
Whoa! What's this?
It looks like a full course meal!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:08.740
Once the meat is done,
the meal will be complete.

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:12.120
Where did you manage to
get these ingredients?

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:17.250
I asked the village huntsmen to teach
me about edible plants and things.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:21.520
You gathered ingredients and cooked
dinner while I was in the bath?

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.250
I worked hard since
I thought you'd be hungry.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.600
You worked way too hard...

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.380
In that case...

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.760
I guess I'll just have to bring out...

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.760
these guys!

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:36.020
Since we've got the chance, let's do
this outside, looking up at the stars!

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:38.060
And now... Cheers!

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:46.500
* Despite appearances,
this is an old guy, aged 32.
This taste is sinful.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:47.900
You've got a mustache.
* Despite appearances,
this is an old guy, aged 32.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.700
I wonder how this will taste...

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.770
The meat's got a sort of wild flavor...

00:14:57.770 --> 00:15:00.340
like a sort of untamed
flavor you get from game.

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:04.170
Hold on. What kind of meat is this?

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:04.920
Forgive me.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:08.050
This is meat from that
guardian deity, isn't it!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:08.560
Sploosh

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:11.020
I drained the blood really well,
so it should taste good.
Sploosh

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.550
That is so not the problem!
Sploosh

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.400
I do feel bad for having deceived you,

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:19.060
but a warm meal is necessary for
restoring energy and willpower.

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:22.000
And without protein, you can't
recover from exhaustion.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.080
Oh. So it's because I said I was tired.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:28.670
Well, having tried it, it was
better than I expected!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.820
The beer is good and the air is clear!

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.670
I've got no complaints!

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:34.820
Yes. It's a nice night.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:38.780
If they've got alcohol in
this world, I want to try it!

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:40.830
Should you be treating this like a vacation?

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:43.690
I've been thinking this
ever since we got here...

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.810
Your sense of responsibility
is way too strong.

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:46.840
You're too serious!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.800
You'll go bald at this rate!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:49.970
Bald?

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:52.530
What's wrong with treating
it like a vacation?

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:55.220
Work's been so busy, so I haven't gone anywhere.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.470
This is a different world, right?

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:59.880
That means no one we know is
here and no one's watching!

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:02.230
Why don't we slow down and take it easy?

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.600
No one's watching?

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:08.080
I see.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:11.430
Now that I think about it, it has been
a while since I took a break this long.

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:14.930
That's right! And we're
in a different world...

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.640
so we can do whatever we want!

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:17.870
Wait. What are you doing?

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:21.620
Someone told me that if I feel hot,
I should remove my clothes.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.490
I see. You're drunk.

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:27.380
I'm not drunk. How could I be
drunk from just one sip of beer?

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.930
That's true, but...

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:32.590
Wait! Your new body might not have
the same alcohol tolerance!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:37.520
Oh, no wonder. That's why everything
looks all sparkly and bright!

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:40.700
It's because I've got a different body!
And it's this body's fault!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.520
Stop babbling!

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:45.770
That's enough for tonight.
Give me your can. Come on.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:46.760
* Despite appearances,
this is an old guy, aged 32.

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:48.270
You idiot!
* Despite appearances,
this is an old guy, aged 32.

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:54.030
That's right. That's so right!

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:57.030
I can do whatever I want in this world!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.200
I am free!
Dash

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:58.630
I am free!

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:00.040
Where are you going, Tachibana?!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.670
This is why I don't like
troublesome drunks...

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:08.840
But Tachibana didn't have a
habit of taking off clothes before.

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:12.640
Does a change of body change
things like that as well?

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:15.840
No, it could also be the
effect of some kind of skill.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:16.130
Information

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:17.700
Blessings of the Goddess of Love MAX
.                                                                                                         .
When feeling openhearted or when
inhibitions are lowered, a sense of liberation
makes one want to remove clothing.
