"blessing" is utterly useless.

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.850
Jinguuji...

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.360
T-Tachibana!

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:34.920
A-Are you all right, Tachibana?

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.650
I don't know why, but I can't move.

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:39.370
Wait there! I'll get you down.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:44.280
Huh? What's happening to me right now?

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:47.120
What's with these springy rope things?

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.130
What's this? It's suddenly pitch black.

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:56.350
It's lowering you down, Tachibana!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:18:00.260
Jinguuji? Where? Where are you?

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:04.640
In this perilous situation, I can't even
look at her because of her skin showing!

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:08.190
Jinguuji, where are you? I feel so lonely!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:08.650
sniffle
Jinguuji, where are you? I feel so lonely!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.400
I'm gonna cry...
sniffle

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.550
Pull your clothes back up! Your clothes!

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.070
I'll be right there! Just wait!

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.790
This thing is a pain in
a simple sort of way...

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:19.700
Oh, it was my clothes.
No wonder it was so dark.

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:23.240
I'll pretend I didn't see that.

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:24.700
Don't hide from reality!

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.860
I seriously want to cry!
Why is this happening?

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:30.460
What am I supposed to do here?

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:32.210
You drank too much!

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.310
If you won't listen when people try to
stop you, things turn out like this!

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:36.430
I don't remember anyone trying to stop me!

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:37.970
I told you over and over to stop!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:42.980
All right. I've gotten scolded and
punished enough. So hurry up and save me.

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:45.850
I want nothing more than to do that, but...

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.540
♥ Charmed
my body won't move an inch!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:49.450
Jinguuji, your head. Your head.
♥ Charmed

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:52.360
Blast! This charmed thing
really is problematic!
♥ Charmed

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:54.330
The reason I can't move...

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:59.240
Deep in my psyche, I want to stare at a
scantily clad Tachibana from a safe distance...

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:00.740
Is that it?

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:03.890
At this rate, Tachibana will
be sucked down and disappear.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:05.990
It's already starting to eat her hair.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:07.260
What do I do?

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:08.860
How can I remove the charmed effect?

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:10.500
Think of something!

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:13.080
Last time, everything worked
out because of that slap.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:16.880
Which means that if I encounter a severe
shock, then this time once again...
♥ Charmed

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.160
Hey, Tachibana!

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:20.840
Can you think of anything that
might shock me if I heard it?

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:26.350
There's nothing in my boring life that
might give you any kind of shock.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:29.230
Anything! Like... things you hate!

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.600
Things I hate, huh?

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:33.350
Anything's fine! Hurry up!

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:36.860
Green bell peppers.
I hate green bell peppers.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:46.120
You're 32 years old and you
still can't eat green bell peppers?

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:53.660
This power from a rage I don't quite
understand has made things work out fine.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.860
Are you all right, Tachibana?

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:01.970
Congratulations on leveling up.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.130
Shut up!

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:07.760
It's fine for you! You can deflect beams!
And you're strong! And you're still a guy!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:12.170
I've turned into a woman and I got blind drunk
and you could never understand how I feel!

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.320
And I can so eat green bell peppers!

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.400
You said that last one out of spite.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:20.150
Why has it always only
me who ends up like this?

00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:24.900
I wanted to be reborn as a hot guy
and have girls fawn over me!

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:27.510
And I always got teased about
my name being like a girl's!

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:30.040
In the end, even my little sister
started calling me Hina-chan!

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:33.080
Jinguuji Tsukasa's a cute name, too!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.170
Why's it only me?!

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.350
I see.

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:40.800
So, back then, you gave the heroine
my name out of spite, did you?

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:44.060
Don't cry, Tachibana.

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:49.190
When you cry, it makes me sad, too.

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:50.810
Come on. Let's head back.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.390
Hey, Jinguuji...

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:07.950
Hm?

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:13.220
Between the body and the spirit...
where do you think gender lies?

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:21.710
I think that whichever you
think is right, is right.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:24.870
Tachibana?

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:33.860
The world today is crap
for real... Total crap.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:36.660
The way you get drunk really shows your age.

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:42.610
In a place like this...

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:52.870
This meat is pretty good.

